    "text": "Let <math><mi>f</mi><mo>:</mo><mfenced close=\"]\" open=\"[\" separators=\"|\"><mrow><mn>0,1</mn></mrow></mfenced><mo>&#8594;</mo><mi>R</mi><mi>&#160;</mi></math> be such that <math><mi>f</mi><mfenced separators=\"|\"><mrow><mi>x</mi><mi>y</mi></mrow></mfenced><mo>=</mo><mi>f</mi><mfenced separators=\"|\"><mrow><mi>x</mi></mrow></mfenced><mo>.</mo><mi>f</mi><mfenced separators=\"|\"><mrow><mi>y</mi></mrow></mfenced><mo>,</mo></math> for all <math><mi>x</mi><mo>,</mo><mi>y</mi><mo>&#8712;</mo><mfenced close=\"]\" open=\"[\" separators=\"|\"><mrow><mn>0,1</mn></mrow></mfenced><mo>,</mo><mi>&#160;</mi></math> and <math><mi>&#160;</mi><mi>f</mi><mo>(</mo><mn>0</mn><mo>)</mo><mo>&#8800;</mo><mn>0</mn><mo>.</mo></math> If <math><mi>y</mi><mo>=</mo><mi>y</mi><mo>(</mo><mi>x</mi><mo>)</mo></math> satisfies the differential equation, <math><mfrac><mrow><mi>d</mi><mi>y</mi></mrow><mrow><mi>d</mi><mi>x</mi></mrow></mfrac><mo>=</mo><mi>f</mi><mfenced separators=\"|\"><mrow><mi>x</mi></mrow></mfenced></math> with <math><mi>y</mi><mfenced separators=\"|\"><mrow><mn>0</mn></mrow></mfenced><mo>=</mo><mn>1</mn></math> then <math><mi>y</mi><mfenced separators=\"|\"><mrow><mfrac><mrow><mn>1</mn></mrow><mrow><mn>4</mn></mrow></mfrac></mrow></mfenced><mo>+</mo><mi>y</mi><mfenced separators=\"|\"><mrow><mfrac><mrow><mn>3</mn></mrow><mrow><mn>4</mn></mrow></mfrac></mrow></mfenced></math> is equal to:",
