  "solution": {
    "text": "<p>Given relation is <math><mi>f</mi><mfenced separators=\"|\"><mrow><mi>x</mi><mi>y</mi></mrow></mfenced><mo>=</mo><mi>f</mi><mfenced separators=\"|\"><mrow><mi>x</mi></mrow></mfenced><mo>.</mo><mi>&#160;</mi><mi>f</mi><mfenced separators=\"|\"><mrow><mi>y</mi></mrow></mfenced><mi>&#160;</mi><mo>&#8704;</mo><mi>&#160;</mi><mi>x</mi><mo>,</mo><mi>&#160;</mi><mi>y</mi><mo>&#8712;</mo><mi>R</mi><mi>&#160;</mi></math> .....(i)<br /><br />On putting <math><mi>x</mi><mo>=</mo><mi>&#160;</mi><mi>y</mi><mo>=</mo><mn>0</mn><mo>,</mo></math> we get <math><mi>f</mi><mfenced separators=\"|\"><mrow><mn>0</mn></mrow></mfenced><mo>=</mo><msup><mrow><mi>f</mi></mrow><mrow><mn>2</mn></mrow></msup><mfenced separators=\"|\"><mrow><mn>0</mn></mrow></mfenced><mo>&#8658;</mo><mi>f</mi><mfenced separators=\"|\"><mrow><mn>0</mn></mrow></mfenced><mo>=</mo><mn>0</mn><mo>,</mo><mi>&#160;</mi><mn>1</mn></math> but</p><p><math><mi>f</mi><mfenced separators=\"|\"><mrow><mn>0</mn></mrow></mfenced><mo>&#8800;</mo><mn>0</mn></math><br /><br /><math><mo>&#8658;</mo><mi>f</mi><mfenced separators=\"|\"><mrow><mn>0</mn></mrow></mfenced><mo>=</mo><mn>1</mn><mo>,</mo></math><br /><br />Now if we put <math><mi>y</mi><mo>=</mo><mn>0</mn></math> in (i), we get<br /><br /><math><mi>f</mi><mfenced separators=\"|\"><mrow><mi>x</mi></mrow></mfenced><mo>=</mo><mn>1</mn></math><br /><br />Hence <math><mfrac><mrow><mi>d</mi><mi>y</mi></mrow><mrow><mi>d</mi><mi>x</mi></mrow></mfrac><mo>=</mo><mn>1</mn><mo>&#8658;</mo><mi>y</mi><mo>=</mo><mi>x</mi><mo>+</mo><mi>c</mi></math><br /><br /><math><mo>&#8658;</mo><mi>y</mi><mo>=</mo><mi>x</mi><mo>+</mo><mn>1</mn></math> <math><mfenced separators=\"|\"><mrow><mi mathvariant=\"normal\">s</mi><mi mathvariant=\"normal\">i</mi><mi mathvariant=\"normal\">n</mi><mi mathvariant=\"normal\">c</mi><mi mathvariant=\"normal\">e</mi><mi>&#160;</mi><mi>y</mi><mfenced separators=\"|\"><mrow><mn>0</mn></mrow></mfenced><mo>=</mo><mn>1</mn></mrow></mfenced></math><br /><br /><math xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/1998/Math/MathML\"><mo>&#8658;</mo><mi>y</mi><mfenced separators=\"|\"><mfrac><mn>1</mn><mn>4</mn></mfrac></mfenced><mo>+</mo><mi>y</mi><mfenced separators=\"|\"><mfrac><mn>3</mn><mn>4</mn></mfrac></mfenced></math></p><p><math xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/1998/Math/MathML\"><mo>=</mo><mfenced separators=\"|\"><mrow><mfrac><mn>1</mn><mn>4</mn></mfrac><mo>+</mo><mn>1</mn></mrow></mfenced><mo>+</mo><mfenced separators=\"|\"><mrow><mfrac><mn>3</mn><mn>4</mn></mfrac><mo>+</mo><mn>1</mn></mrow></mfenced><mo>=</mo><mn>3</mn><mo>.</mo></math></p>",
